1
00:00:00,598 --> 00:00:03,518
(Howard:)Ow! Damn. Paper cut.
Nothing worse than a paper cut.

2
00:00:03,684 --> 00:00:07,564
(Raj:)Well, obviously,
you don't remember your circumcision.

3
00:00:09,231 --> 00:00:12,271
(Sheldon:)There's Neosporin and Band-Aids
in my top desk drawer.

4
00:00:12,443 --> 00:00:14,773
(Howard:)Why don't you keep that stuff
in the bathroom?

5
00:00:14,945 --> 00:00:18,535
(Leonard:)He does. And in the kitchen,
and in the car, and in his pocket.

6
00:00:18,699 --> 00:00:20,779
(Sheldon:)Yeah, but the ones in my pocket
are mine.

7
00:00:22,453 --> 00:00:24,243
(Scene:)-Hi.
-Hey.

8
00:00:24,413 --> 00:00:26,583
Guess who's gonna be
at the comic store on Thursday.

9
00:00:26,749 --> 00:00:29,749
(Penny:)-Um, can you give me a hint?
-Stan Lee.

10
00:00:29,919 --> 00:00:34,049
(Penny:)Um, Stanley. Stanley. Stanley Tucci?

11
00:00:34,215 --> 00:00:37,885
No, ha, ha. No. Stan Lee.

12
00:00:38,052 --> 00:00:41,762
Oh. Oh, Stan Lee. Cool.

13
00:00:41,931 --> 00:00:43,221
[CHUCKLES]

14
00:00:44,516 --> 00:00:46,186
(Leonard:)You have no idea who he is, do you?

15
00:00:46,393 --> 00:00:49,103
(Penny:)Of course I do.
You're an important part of my life...

16
00:00:49,271 --> 00:00:52,481
(Penny:)...and I pay attention to the things
you are interested in.

17
00:00:52,650 --> 00:00:54,980
(Leonard:)-Good. Good.
-Heh, heh.

18
00:00:55,152 --> 00:00:56,232
(Leonard:)So who's Stan Lee?

19
00:00:57,154 --> 00:01:03,024
(Penny:)Um, he was on Star Trek.

